  &lt;body>
    &lt;p>
Shows the various versions of the top-level class Thing that are imported/created by &lt;a href="https://www.omg.org/spec/MVF/20220501/AboutMVF.rdf">AboutMVF.rdf&lt;/a> and its sub-ontologies.

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
«Equivalent Class» assertions are added to indicate that all these top-level elements are equivalent.

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
To reduce the number of assertions, the RDF&amp;#160;schema acts as a hub for the equivalence is a transitive property in SKOS . This is sufficient because equivalence is transitive (see &lt;a href="mdel://_19_0_4_c480314_1688572993823_733300_11622" erit:display="CUSTOM_TEXT" erit:update="NO_UPDATE">skos:exactMatch&lt;/a>).

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
&amp;#160;

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
For relationships and properties of Things, see diagrams: &lt;a href="mdel://_19_0_4_c480314_1690797405443_595719_11447" erit:display="NAME" erit:update="AUTOMATIC_UPDATE">MVF Metamodel - Relationships between Things that have inter-relationships&lt;/a> and

    &lt;/p>

    &lt;p>
